    "title": "Thursday Night Music Battles",
    "description": "Hey GF/BF! Do you have any plan tonight?\r\nAre you willing to enjoy this music party?\r\nPlay Thursday Night Music Battles for weeks to get more great tips. You will easily beat all other indie friends (like Silly Billy, Twiddle Finger) in digital music party.\r\n\r\n*HOW TO ENJOY THIS MOD?*\r\nPress at the arrow in time with the beat and the music to achieve the highest score.\r\nFeel digital rhythm! Rock the beat! Rap in cg5 music! Beat all enemies from Indie cross!\r\n\r\n*GAME FEATURE*\r\n- Easy to play\r\n- All for FREE, play offline anywhere\r\n- Magic arrows go up follow digital rhythm\r\n- Awesome graphics and amazing sound effects\r\n- High-quality backgrounds from over 7 week\r\n- Be updated frequently!\r\n\r\nHave fun!\r\nFollow our game community for any issues!",
